pected:\r\n3x4x5xui8=[[18 24 22 22 20][14 38 44 14 27][30 14 20 12 20][36 25 31 6 8]][[28 30 19 7 18][26 33 23 34 19][29 39 14 32 44][26 25 18 28 24]][[24 36 16 28 25][16 23 22 20 39][27 20 34 19 26][16 17 8 16 11]]\r\n  actual:\r\n3x4x5xi8=[[18 24 22 22 20][14 38 44 14 27][30 14 20 12 20][36 25 31 6 8]][[28 30 19 7 18][26 33 23 34 19][29 39 14 32 44][26 25 18 28 24]][[24 36 16 28 25][16 23 22 20 39][27 20 34 19 26][16 17 8 16 11]]\r\n\r\nCompiled with: iree-compile model.mlir --iree-hal-target-backends=llvm-cpu -o model_cpu_llvm_sync_test.vmfb\r\n\r\nRun with: iree-run-module --module=model_cpu_llvm_sync_test.vmfb --device=local-sync --flagfile=test_data_flags.txt\r\n ```\r\n MLIR :\r\n ```\r\n module {\r\n  func.func @test_add_uint8(%arg0: !torch.vtensor<[3,4,5],ui8>, %arg1: !torch.vtensor<[3,4,5],ui8>) -> !torch.vtensor<[3,4,5],ui8> attributes {torch.onnx_meta.ir_version = 7 : si64, torch.onnx_meta.opset_version = 17 : si64, torch.onnx_meta.producer_name = \"backend-test\", torch.onnx_meta.producer_version = \"\"} {\r\n    %none = torch.constant.none\r\n    %0 = torch.operator \"onnx.Add\"(%arg0, %arg1) : (!torch.vtensor<[3,4,5],ui8>, !torch.vtensor<[3,4,5],ui8>) -> !torch.vtensor<[3,4,5],ui8> \r\n    return %0 : !torch.vtensor<[3,4,5],ui8>\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n ```\r\n iree-compiler  and runtime versions : `20240326.843`","closed_at":"2024-03-27T17:06:16Z","closed_by":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4010439?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ScottTodd/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ScottTodd/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ScottTodd/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ScottTodd/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ScottTodd","id":4010439,"login":"ScottTodd","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMTA0Mzk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ScottTodd/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ScottTodd/rec